<%- include('../partials/header-landing') %>

<style>
  :root {
    --kk-primary: #0d6efd;
    --kk-primary-dark: #0b5ed7;
    --kk-primary-light: rgba(13,110,253,0.08);
    --kk-gradient: linear-gradient(135deg, #0d6efd, #0dcaf0);
    --kk-shadow-sm: 0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
    --kk-radius: 1.5rem;
  }

  .kk-header {
    background: var(--kk-gradient); border-radius: var(--kk-radius); padding: 3rem 2rem;
    color: #fff; margin-bottom: 2.5rem; text-align: center; box-shadow: 0 15px 30px rgba(13,110,253,0.25);
  }
  .kk-header h1 { font-weight: 800; font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.8rem); margin-bottom: .5rem; }
  .kk-header p { opacity: .9; font-size: 1.05rem; margin: 0; max-width: 640px; margin-inline: auto; }

  .kk-card {
    background: #fff; border-radius: 1.2rem; box-shadow: var(--kk-shadow-sm);
    border: 1px solid rgba(13,110,253,0.1); padding: 1.6rem 1.8rem; margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
  }
  .kk-card h3 { font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.1rem; color: #1e293b; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:.5rem; margin-bottom: .7rem; }
  .kk-card h3 i { color: var(--kk-primary); }
  .kk-card ul { margin: 0; padding-left: 1.2rem; color: #475569; font-size: .95rem; }
  .kk-card ul li { margin-bottom: .4rem; }

  .download-box {
    background: #fff; border-radius: var(--kk-radius); box-shadow: var(--kk-shadow-sm);
    border: 1px solid rgba(13,110,253,0.1); padding: 1.8rem; margin-top: 1.5rem;
    display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1rem;
  }
  .download-box .txt h3 { font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.15rem; margin-bottom: .2rem; color: #1e293b; }
  .download-box .txt p { margin: 0; color: #64748b; font-size: .9rem; }
  .btn-download {
    background: var(--kk-gradient); color: #fff; border: none; padding: .7rem 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 50px; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; white-space: nowrap;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 16px rgba(13,110,253,0.25); transition: .2s; display:inline-flex; align-items:center;
  }
  .btn-download:hover { color: #fff; transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 12px 20px rgba(13,110,253,0.3); }

  .note-box {
    background: #eff5ff; border: 1px solid #bfe0f5; border-radius: 1rem; padding: 1.1rem 1.3rem;
    color: #0b5ed7; font-size: .9rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; display: flex; gap: .7rem;
  }
</style>

<div class="kk-header">
  <h1><i class="bi bi-file-earmark-check-fill me-2"></i>Kontrak Kuliah</h1>
  <p>Kesepakatan pembelajaran antara dosen pengampu dan mahasiswa untuk setiap mata kuliah, disusun mengacu pada RPS Program Studi Teknik Elektronika.</p>
</div>

<div class="note-box">
  <i class="bi bi-info-circle-fill"></i>
  <div>Template ini digunakan oleh dosen pengampu untuk menyusun kontrak kuliah di awal semester, memuat capaian pembelajaran, bobot penilaian, tata tertib, dan kriteria kelulusan yang disepakati bersama mahasiswa.</div>
</div>

<div class="kk-card">
  <h3><i class="bi bi-list-check"></i>Isi Kontrak Kuliah</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>Deskripsi dan Capaian Pembelajaran Mata Kuliah (CPMK)</li>
    <li>Ringkasan materi 16 kali pertemuan</li>
    <li>Komponen dan bobot penilaian (sikap, tugas, praktik, UTS, UAS)</li>
    <li>Kriteria kelulusan dan konversi nilai huruf mutu</li>
    <li>Tata tertib perkuliahan dan jadwal konsultasi dosen</li>
    <li>Lembar pengesahan dosen dan perwakilan mahasiswa</li>
  </ul>
</div>

<div class="download-box">
  <div class="txt">
    <h3><i class="bi bi-file-earmark-word-fill text-primary me-1"></i>Template Kontrak Kuliah (.docx)</h3>
    <p>Unduh, isi identitas mata kuliah pada bagian awal, lalu gunakan untuk kesepakatan kelas Anda.</p>
  </div>
  <a href="<%= fileUrl || '#' %>" class="btn-download" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
    <i class="bi bi-download me-1"></i>Unduh Template
  </a>
</div>

<%- include('../partials/footer-landing') %>
